@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Register
# @name register
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "password": "a-long-demo-password" }

### Push a customer
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "changes": [ { "opId": "{{$guid}}", "entity": "customer", "id": "cust-demo-1", "baseVersion": 0,
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T10:00:00.000Z", "data": { "name": "Demo Customer" } } ] }

### Pull everything
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sync/pull?since=0
Authorization: Bearer {{register.response.body.accessToken}}

### No token → 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sync/pull
